"""
Workflow 12 -- Evaluation of fine-tuned Borzoi trunks on the FOLD_1 test set.

Evaluates an ensemble of replicate Borzoi trunks (config
finetuning.borzoi.evaluation, one directory per replicate under
results/finetuning/borzoi/trunk_r{0..3}) fine-tuned on the SF3B1 RNA-seq
tracks (2 samples x 2 strands).

Steps per subset, mirroring workflows/06-evaluation and
workflows/10-jax_finetuning so metrics can be recomputed without repeating
inference:
  1. collect_predictions_borzoi -- GPU inference per trunk, untransform
                                    (soft clip / sqrt / scale), mean over trunks
  2. export_alphagenome_format  -- CPU: write the AlphaGenome-schema RNA-seq
                                    parquets (same helper definitions)
  3. compute_eval_metrics       -- CPU: src/scripts/compute_eval_metrics.py,
                                    unchanged, so metrics.parquet is directly
                                    comparable to the AlphaGenome runs
Optional (not in `rule all`): compute_metrics_borzoi computes the upstream
profile + gene-expression metrics at 1 bp and 32 bp from the raw predictions
(summary.json; needs ~512 GB). Request it explicitly:
    results/evaluation/borzoi/full/{subset}/summary.json

The model and metric code is the unmodified upstream evaluation script
(scripts/upstream/, abuendia/alphagenome-pytorch, branch abuen/borzoi-eval).

Subsets:
  test          -- held-out test intervals
  train_sample  -- seeded random sample of train intervals, same size as test

Outputs:
  results/evaluation/borzoi/full/{subset}/predictions/{predictions_32bp.npy,regions.parquet,run_info.json}
  results/evaluation/borzoi/full/{subset}/predictions/*.parquet (AlphaGenome schema)
  results/evaluation/borzoi/full/{subset}/metrics.parquet, metrics.json

Run with:
    snakemake -s workflows/12-borzoi_evaluation/Snakefile --use-conda [-n]

Submit real runs via SLURM, not on the login node:
    ./src/scripts/submit_snakemake_slurm.sh \\
        "snakemake -s workflows/12-borzoi_evaluation/Snakefile --use-conda -j 2 --rerun-incomplete"
"""

configfile: "config/config.yaml"

include: "rules/evaluate.smk"

rule all:
    input:
        EVAL_TARGETS,
